<%# Said plainly wherever a percentage or an average is drawn from a handful of answers,
    so the page never presents a number as though it settled something. %>
<p class="mt-4 rounded-md bg-amber-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-amber-800 ring-1 ring-inset ring-amber-200">
  Only <%= pluralize(count, "answer") %> so far. One more would move these numbers a long
  way, so read them as a listing rather than as a summary.
</p>
